{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:khevodo_ihel/1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"כְּבוֹדוֹ, אִהֵל כְּהַיּוֹם בְּרַחֲמִים מֶלֶךְ. "}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"description","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:instruction:role/reader","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:abbr","attrs":{}}
{"text":"ח׳"}
{"end":"t:abbr"}
{"start":"t:expan","attrs":{}}
{"text":"חזן"}
{"end":"t:expan"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":" בּוֹחֵן כָּל־עֶשְׁתּוֹנוֹת צָעִיר וָרַב, מֶֽלֶךְ. גֵּאוּת וָעוֹז הִתְאַזָּר מֶֽלֶךְ. דּוֹק וָחֶֽלֶד יֶחֶרְדוּן מֵאֵֽימַת מֶֽלֶךְ: "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:khevodo_ihel/2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הַיּוֹצֵר יַחַד לִבָּם יָחוֹן מֶלֶךְ. וּמֵבִין אֶל־כָּל־מַעֲשֵׂיהֶם יַצְדִּיק מֶלֶךְ. זִכָּרוֹן הוּא יוֹם תְּרוּעַת מֶלֶךְ. "}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"description","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:instruction:role/reader","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:abbr","attrs":{}}
{"text":"ח׳"}
{"end":"t:abbr"}
{"start":"t:expan","attrs":{}}
{"text":"חזן"}
{"end":"t:expan"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":" חֹק לְיִשְׂרָאֵל הוּא לְזַכּוֹתָם מֶֽלֶךְ. טֶֽרֶף נָתַן לִירֵאָיו מַמְלִיךְ כָּל־מֶֽלֶךְ. יִזְכּוֹר לְעוֹלָם בְּרִיתוֹ בְּזִכְרוֹן טוֹב מֶֽלֶךְ: "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:khevodo_ihel/3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"כָּלָה אַל תַּעַשׂ לִשְׁאֵרִית בְּנֵי מֶלֶךְ. לָכֵן אָתָנוּ לְךָ מַלְכֵּנוּ מֶלֶךְ. מֵאֶתְמוֹל קִדַּמְנוּךָ לְחַלּוֹתְךָ "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n107.jpg","n":"40"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"מֶלֶךְ: "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:khevodo_ihel/4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"description","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:instruction:role/reader","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:abbr","attrs":{}}
{"text":"ח׳"}
{"end":"t:abbr"}
{"start":"t:expan","attrs":{}}
{"text":"חזן"}
{"end":"t:expan"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":" נָא נְצוֹר חֶֽסֶד לְנִינֵי שָׁלְֽחוּ לוֹ שְׁלֹשֶׁת אֵֽילֵי מֶֽלֶךְ. סְכוֹת בָּאֵי בְתַחַן לְמַר בָּכוּ אֶרְאֶלֵּי מֶֽלֶךְ. עֱנוּתָם בַּל תְּבֶז לְלָן בַּמָּקוֹם עָלוּ וְיָרְדוּ בוֹ מַלְאֲכֵי מֶֽלֶךְ: "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:khevodo_ihel/5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"פְּדֵם הַיּוֹם מִדִּין גָּמוּר מִלְּחַיְּבֵם מֶֽלֶךְ. "}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"description","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:instruction:role/reader","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:abbr","attrs":{}}
{"text":"ח׳"}
{"end":"t:abbr"}
{"start":"t:expan","attrs":{}}
{"text":"חזן"}
{"end":"t:expan"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":" צַדְּקֵם בְּרַחֲמִים וּפָקְדֵם לְטוֹבָה מֶֽלֶךְ. "}
{"start":"j:conditional","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}id":"khevodo_ihel_segment_18"}}
{"start":"j:all","attrs":{}}
